OL,3,GNEWSCRTE and other Irish media outlets
OL,4,Cevacuated after bomb threats
OL,5,
OL,6,FRTE evacuated its Donnybrook campus
OL,7,Fthis morning after a threatening e-mail
OL,8,Fwas sent to the broadcaster and scores
OL,9,Fof other media outlets across Ireland.
OL,11,FDirector General Kevin Bakhurst said
OL,12,Fthe e-mail arrived at 8.33am and
OL,13,Freached him at 8.40am.
OL,15,FAfter quick consultation with his
OL,16,Fdeputy, a colleague contacted gardai
OL,17,Fand the decision was taken to evacuate
OL,18,Fon the basis of staff safety.
OL,20,FGardai searched buildings at the RTE
OL,21,Fcomplex and used sniffer dogs.
OL,23,EPub: 06-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
