OL,3,GNEWSCRTE and other Irish media outlets
OL,4,Cevacuated after bomb threats
OL,5,
OL,6,FMediahaus and Independent News Media
OL,7,Fbriefly evacuated their Talbot Street
OL,8,Foffices in Dublin while security checks
OL,9,Fwere carried out, and staff due to
OL,10,Ftravel in were told to work from home
OL,11,Funtil the alert ended.
OL,13,FVirgin Media received the same threat
OL,14,Fbut did not evacuate and continued
OL,15,Fbroadcasting.
OL,17,FGardai confirmed they are aware of a
OL,18,Fthreat made against media organisations
OL,19,Fin Ireland and elsewhere in Europe.
OL,23,EPub: 06-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
