OL,3,GNEWSCRTE and other Irish media outlets
OL,4,Cevacuated after bomb threats
OL,5,
OL,6,GON-AIR IMPACTS AT RTE
OL,8,FEvacuation of buildings at RTE
OL,9,Fincluding the Television Centre and
OL,10,FRadio Centre began shortly after
OL,11,F8.40am.
OL,13,FArrangements were quickly made to keep
OL,14,FRTE TV and radio services on the air
OL,15,Fand broadcasting continued throughout
OL,16,Fthe period of evacuation.
OL,18,FRTE One and RTE 2 were already running
OL,19,Fa schedule comprising pre-recorded
OL,20,Fprogramming. RTE Radio services soon
OL,21,Fswitched from live to pre-recorded
OL,22,Foutput.
OL,23,EPub: 06-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
