OL,3,GNEWSCRTE and other Irish media outlets
OL,4,Cevacuated after bomb threats
OL,5,
OL,6,FRTE Radio 1 resumed live broadcasting
OL,7,Ffrom a small OB unit (the "roadcaster")
OL,8,Fon the RTE campus at around 10.40am.
OL,10,FStaff were allowed to return to work
OL,11,Fshortly after 12.30pm.
OL,13,FRTE One's planned live programming went
OL,14,Fout as scheduled at lunchtime.
OL,16,FNormal service resumed across RTE Radio
OL,17,Fshortly after the alert was over.
